SUMMARY:In The Other Room: Nico Carney
LOCATION:Portland
DESCRIPTION:Nico Carney is a Brooklyn-based stand-up\, writer\, and actor. 
 He was recently cast in the independent feature film from Gloria Sanchez Pr
 oductions\, HERE FOR THE WEEKEND\, starring opposite Patti Harrison as the 
 romantic lead. Nico also stars in the indie film SHE'S THE HE\, which premi
 ered at SXSW in 2025. In 2024\, he made his late-night debut on LATE NIGHT 
 WITH SETH MEYERS and was named a 2024  Comic You Should And Will Know  by
  Vulture. Nico was selected as a JFL New Face in 2023 and was part of the i
 naugural Netflix "Introducing..." showcase at the 2022 Netflix Is a Joke fe
 stival as well as being a featured comedian in the 2025 CBS Showcase. He an
 d his comedy partner Conor Janda also co-host the podcast and live show\, B
 OYS CLUB.\n\nThere is a two-item per person minimum in the Showroom\, which
  can be fulfilled with any food or drink items from the menu.\n\nPLEASE NOT
 E: Food and drinks purchased in the bar and lounge do not count towards the
  two-item minimum.\n\nManagement reserves the right to prevent customers fr
 om entering the facility who they deem disruptive or dangerous to other pat
 rons.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/in-the-other-r
 oom-nico-carney-21922/
